1
00:00:01,660 --> 00:00:03,580
问个问题 我需要雇一个助理
Question. I need to hire an assistant.

2
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:04,900
你觉得雇第二符合资格的
Do you think it would be unethical

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,720
是不是违反职业道德啊
to hire the second most qualified candidate?

4
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:08,060
最符合资格的有什么问题吗
What's wrong with the most qualified?

5
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,200
从斯坦福大学工程系毕业后
And after graduating Stanford engineering,

6
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:13,180
我拿到了著名的罗德奖学金
I was offered a Rhodes Scholarship.

7
00:00:14,260 --> 00:00:15,400
你有什么问题要问我吗
Do you have any questions for me?

8
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,920
我一定要忍住在他面前痴笑才行
I definitely have to carve out some extra time for giggling.

9
00:00:19,120 --> 00:00:20,620
你不能歧视那个可怜的家伙
You can't discriminate against the poor guy

10
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:21,776
长得性感帅气就活该被歧视吗
just because he's a smoke show.

11
00:00:21,776 --> 00:00:24,640
我这一辈子都在跟"性感羞辱"作斗争
I've been battling hot-shaming my entire life.

12
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:25,720
求你别说"帅哥美女的命也很重要"
Please don't say "hot lives matter."

13
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:28,140
外公 怎么了
Grandpa. What's up?

14
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:29,940
把这东西还给你妈
Returning this to your mom.

15
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:31,280
这个帅小伙是谁
Who's the beefcake?

16
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:33,797
我需要雇个助理
I need to hire an assistant,

17
00:00:33,797 --> 00:00:35,900
这位先生目前是排在第一位的
and this gentleman is currently the frontrunner.

18
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:37,019
他是像普通人一样领工资
Does he get a normal paycheck,

19
00:00:37,019 --> 00:00:39,340
还是你要把现金塞进他的丁字裤里 像脱衣舞男那样
or are you just gonna stuff ones down his G-string?

20
00:00:39,340 --> 00:00:41,220
我的确惧怕大众戴有色眼镜来看待这事
I do have some trepidation about the optics.

21
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:43,620
你是应该惧怕 现在是敏感时期
Well, you should. These are sensitive times.

22
00:00:43,760 --> 00:00:44,980
先入为主的认知可能决定了一切
Perception is everything.

23
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:47,400
我才不在意这些乱七八糟的
I didn't care about any of that crap.

24
00:00:47,420 --> 00:00:49,760
我没有足够的工作量分配给我的助理玛格丽特
I don't have enough work for my assistant, Margaret.

25
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:51,180
她都跟了我40年了
Been with me 40 years.

26
00:00:51,420 --> 00:00:52,880
我总不能直接把她丢弃
I can't just put her out to pasture

27
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:54,880
就像处理年迈孱弱的老马一样
like some worn-out plow horse.

28
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,780
那个小老太太该得到一点尊重
The old broad deserves a little respect.

29
00:00:57,440 --> 00:00:59,100
无意冒犯 外公 但我需要的是一个
No offense, Grandpa, but I need someone

30
00:00:59,100 --> 00:01:00,120
能冲锋陷阵的千里马
who can hit the ground running.

31
00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:02,360
玛格丽特更像是撞到人
Margaret's more someone who would hit a pedestrian

32
00:01:02,360 --> 00:01:03,278
都意识不到的糊涂马
and not even realize it.

33
00:01:03,278 --> 00:01:05,060
就算她不是女强人克丽斯蒂·布林克利
Just because she's no Christie Brinkley,

34
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:06,780
顺便说下 她还比玛格丽特大一岁呢
who, by the way, is a year older than Margaret,

35
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:08,560
并不意味着我们就该把她丢到垃圾堆里
doesn't mean we throw her on the scrap heap.

36
00:01:08,720 --> 00:01:10,140
那她必须明天就上班
Well, she'd have to start tomorrow.

37
00:01:10,420 --> 00:01:11,720
她能接受周六工作吗
Is she okay working on a Saturday?

38
00:01:11,940 --> 00:01:13,279
这就是雇佣一个
That's the advantage of hiring somebody

39
00:01:13,279 --> 00:01:15,187
早上6点就精力充沛的人的好处
with a few miles on her by 6:00 A.M.,

40
00:01:15,187 --> 00:01:16,700
她那个时间点已经吃了两个水煮蛋
she will have had two soft-boiled eggs

41
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:17,640
元气十足地准备大干一场了
and be raring to go.

42
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:32,940
小卡 快点 我们走吧
Cam, come on, let's go.

43
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:35,220
不行 稍等一会儿 我得弄完这个
No, hold on just a second. I need to finish this.

44
00:01:35,220 --> 00:01:37,934
求你告诉我你不是又在搞写信请愿的事
Please tell me this isn't another letter-writing campaign.

45
00:01:37,934 --> 00:01:39,658
他们不会将我们的街道重新命名的
They're not going to rename our street.

46
00:01:39,658 --> 00:01:40,860
如果改成"玫琳凯大街"
Okay, Mary Kay Place would be

47
00:01:40,860 --> 00:01:42,900
那将是对美国国宝很有趣的致敬
a very fun tribute to an American treasure,

48
00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:44,280
但可惜不是 这次不是为了那个事
but, no, that's not what this is.

49
00:01:44,380 --> 00:01:45,540
小卡 快点 我想快点走
Cam, come on. I want to go.

50
00:01:45,540 --> 00:01:47,400
商店半小时后就开门了
The store opens in a half-hour, okay?

51
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:49,580
你知道我总是趁这促销买够一年穿的裤子
You know I get all my pants for the entire year at this sale,

52
00:01:49,580 --> 00:01:51,600
32英寸是大众尺码 很多人抢
and 32 is a very, very common pant size.

53
00:01:51,720 --> 00:01:52,878
你要是有哪一天
It'd be great if we could go a day

54
00:01:52,878 --> 00:01:55,060
不提你32英寸的腰围就好了
without you mentioning your 32-inch waist size.

55
00:01:55,060 --> 00:01:56,019
不行 这事很紧急
No, this is urgent.

56
00:01:56,019 --> 00:01:59,020
卡普兰先生砍掉了我在教职工演出会上的
Senor Kaplan cut my "Wind Beneath My Wings" number

57
00:01:59,020 --> 00:02:01,280
《翅膀下的风》独唱曲目 说是时长问题
at the faculty follies "for time."

58
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:03,460
所以我要向国税局举报他
So I'm turning him in to the IRS

59
00:02:03,460 --> 00:02:05,200
早餐吃的墨西哥卷饼都算作可扣除税款
for deducting his breakfast burritos.

60
00:02:05,460 --> 00:02:07,560
你把生命都浪费在对付这些死对头上了
You're wasting your life with these rivalries.

61
00:02:07,660 --> 00:02:10,060
我有个同事 每次都吃掉我的花生酱
There is a guy at work who always eats my peanut butter,

62
00:02:10,100 --> 00:02:12,410
但我每次都算了 因为人生苦短
but I just let it go because life's too short

63
00:02:12,410 --> 00:02:14,102
他个头也很短 或许那些花生酱
and so is he, and maybe the peanut butter

64
00:02:14,102 --> 00:02:16,239
就是他缺爱的人生里那人间真情的替代品
is just his creamy substitute for human affection.

65
00:02:16,239 --> 00:02:18,530
好了吗 能走了吗 快走吧
Okay? Can we go? Could we please go?

66
00:02:18,530 --> 00:02:19,382
-可以了 -真是谢谢你了
- Yes. - Thank you.

67
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,279
天啊
Oh, my gosh.

68
00:02:21,279 --> 00:02:23,480
我... 请问有什么事吗
I'm s-- Uh... C-Can we help you?

69
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:24,760
我叫莫里·克拉格
Name's Murray Clark.

70
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:26,540
我是在这房子里长大的
I grew up in this house.

71
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:30,720
你好 我叫卡梅隆 这是我丈夫米奇尔
Hi. Well, my name is Cameron. This is my husband, Mitchell.

72
00:02:30,960 --> 00:02:32,180
那可真够搞笑的
Well, that's funny.

73
00:02:33,047 --> 00:02:36,180
好吧 我们要出门了
Okay. Uh, so, we were just about to leave.

74
00:02:36,180 --> 00:02:36,920
我所有的裤子都得在...
See, I get all my pants --

75
00:02:36,940 --> 00:02:39,600
我去参战后 就没见过这房子了
I haven't seen this house since I went off to war.

76
00:02:39,980 --> 00:02:41,560
你是想进来
Oh, and you'd like to come in

77
00:02:41,560 --> 00:02:42,860
看一眼曾经居住的房子吗
and take a look around a little bit?

78
00:02:42,900 --> 00:02:44,340
不 不是那样的
No, nothing like that.

79
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,500
我是来死的
I just came here to die.

80
00:02:47,055 --> 00:02:48,936
-什么 -你说什么
- Uh, excuse me? - I'm sorry?

81
00:02:48,936 --> 00:02:52,164
没什么好悲伤的 我死得很快的
Oh, it's nothing sad. I'll just be a minute.

82
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:58,980
话说 能先给我一杯果汁喝吗
Actually, could I get a juice first?

83
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:00,100
当然可以
Oh, of course.

84
00:03:00,100 --> 00:03:01,643
-有何不可呢 -好的
- Why not? - Sure, yeah.

85
00:03:03,700 --> 00:03:05,820
-你在干什么 -当一个热情好客的主人啊
- What are you doing? - Being a gracious host.

86
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:07,529
招待一个想死在这里的陌生人吗
To a stranger who wants to die here?

87
00:03:07,529 --> 00:03:09,120
拜托 米奇尔 不会发生任何事的
Oh, come on, Mitchell, nothing's going to happen.

88
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,300
他这样只是在哭求帮助而已
It's just a cry for help.

89
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:12,960
那行 如果我买不到一条修身版的法国蓝斜纹棉布裤
Okay, if I can't get a pair of slim-cut chinos in French Blue,

90
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,160
会死在这里的人将是你
you're gonna die here.

91
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:16,860
-马文 米尔顿 -不 他叫莫里
- Marvin? Milton? - No, it's Murray.

92
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:19,340
莫里 莫里 莫里
Murray? Murray! Murray!

93
00:03:19,340 --> 00:03:20,476
天啊 他是真死了吗
Oh, my God. Did he actually die?

94
00:03:20,476 --> 00:03:22,860
冷静 我是获得认证的急救员
Calm down! I'm -- I'm first aid certified!

95
00:03:22,860 --> 00:03:22,980
莫里
Murray?

96
00:03:23,780 --> 00:03:24,220
莫里
Murray!!

97
00:03:24,420 --> 00:03:26,583
你的急救知识是谁叫的 死囚病房的保姆吗
Who taught you first aid, a nanny on death row?

98
00:03:26,583 --> 00:03:28,226
-快醒醒 -该死的
- Wake up! - Damn it!

99
00:03:28,260 --> 00:03:30,420
我乘坐经济舱大老远从佛罗里达州飞来
I flew coach all the way from Florida

100
00:03:30,420 --> 00:03:33,060
就为了死在这房子里 结果被你们毁了
to die in this house, and you ruined it!

101
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:34,259
天啊 真是太疯狂了
Oh, my God. That's insane.

102
00:03:34,259 --> 00:03:36,396
你都知道你要死了 还坐经济舱
You knew you were going to die and you flew coach?

103
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:38,160
你在干什么
What are you doing?

104
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:40,940
我在把简历修改得漂亮点
Oh, I'm trying to spruce up my resume.

105
00:03:41,040 --> 00:03:42,400
找工作简直快要烦死我了
This job hunt is killing me.

106
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:43,600
我很遗憾 妈
I'm sorry, Mom,

107
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:45,880
但如果那些公司都不够明智 不肯雇你
but if those companies aren't smart enough to hire you,

108
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:47,200
那你也不会想跟他们共事的
you don't want to work with them anyway.

109
00:03:47,300 --> 00:03:48,920
以前艾丽克斯找不到男人 我就是这么劝她的
That's what I used to tell Alex about boys.

110
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:50,480
别拿到第一个邀约就答应
Just don't jump at the first offer.

111
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:52,420
以前我也是这么叮嘱你不要轻易上男人的钩的
That's what I used to tell you about boys.

112
00:03:52,720 --> 00:03:54,676
他来了 他来了
He's here! He's here!!

113
00:03:54,676 --> 00:03:57,300
今天 我们曾经的邻居 如今的科技大亨
Today, our old neighbor- turned-tech-titan,

114
00:03:57,300 --> 00:03:58,620
肯尼斯 要造访我们家
Kenneth, is coming to visit.

115
00:03:58,640 --> 00:04:00,620
他说他为我准备了一个大惊喜
And he says he has a "big surprise" for me.

116
00:04:00,980 --> 00:04:03,600
我不知道富豪是不是有时间旅行的门路
I don't know if the super rich have access to time travel,

117
00:04:03,600 --> 00:04:05,460
但如果他们有的话 我要回90年代
but if they do, I'm going back to the '90s.

118
00:04:05,660 --> 00:04:07,640
去买一堆亚马逊的股票吗
Ooh, to buy a whole bunch of Amazon stock?

119
00:04:07,860 --> 00:04:08,260
不是
No!

120
00:04:09,756 --> 00:04:12,213
我会叫费莉希蒂不要剪头发
I'm going to tell Felicity not to cut her hair.

121
00:04:19,358 --> 00:04:20,142
太好了
Okay.

122
00:04:20,163 --> 00:04:23,240
-海莉 快来群抱 -不 我就免了吧
- Haley, get in here! - Nah, I'm good.

123
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:25,303
你不加入 我们是不会放开彼此的
We're not letting go of each other until you get in here.

124
00:04:25,303 --> 00:04:26,308
海莉 快来群抱
Haley, get in the hug!

125
00:04:27,740 --> 00:04:30,000
这感觉太爽了
Oh, this feels so good!

126
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:32,560
当然了 但是比拥抱更爽的是...
Sure, but who needs hugs when you can...

127
00:04:32,635 --> 00:04:34,169
-男人式握手 -男人式握手
- Man-shake! - Man-shake!

128
00:04:34,421 --> 00:04:36,301
你最好给他们点空间完成这个仪式
You're gonna want to give them some space for this.

129
00:04:40,780 --> 00:04:42,460
搞摄像机来是要干什么啊
Ooh, what are the cameras for?

130
00:04:44,140 --> 00:04:46,780
这是为一部纪录片准备的 要拍科技远见家
This is for a documentary about tech visionaries

131
00:04:46,780 --> 00:04:49,280
回去感谢那些赋予他们灵感的人
going back to thank the people who inspired them.

132
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:51,800
伊隆·马斯克给他的数学老师买了一座岛
Elon Musk got his math teacher an island.

133
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,008
那我能得到什么
What am I getting?

134
00:04:53,008 --> 00:04:54,420
假设那个人 是我
Assuming it's...me.

135
00:04:54,420 --> 00:04:55,860
-摄像机在拍了吗 -是的
- Well, are the cameras rolling? - Yes.

136
00:04:56,720 --> 00:05:00,380
我们曾经一直梦想一起做的事是什么
What is the one thing that we've always dreamed of doing together?

137
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:01,920
去纽约跟费莉希蒂一起上大学
Going to college in New York with Felicity?

138
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:02,680
不是
No.

139
00:05:03,740 --> 00:05:05,340
这个家伙
This man right here,

140
00:05:05,340 --> 00:05:08,100
教我要永远心怀远大的梦想
he taught me to always dream big

141
00:05:08,100 --> 00:05:09,500
伸手摘星辰
and reach for the stars.

142
00:05:09,958 --> 00:05:12,509
为了感谢你 菲尔
And as a thank-you, Phil,

143
00:05:12,640 --> 00:05:15,420
你是否愿意让我成为地球上最幸福的男人
would you make me the happiest man on Earth

144
00:05:15,420 --> 00:05:18,180
和我一起飞离地球
and leave Earth with me?

145
00:05:18,664 --> 00:05:19,740
什么
W-W-What?!

146
00:05:19,740 --> 00:05:24,260
我刚刚订了两张下一趟俄罗斯航班的票
I just got us two tickets on the next Russian flight

147
00:05:24,260 --> 00:05:27,580
飞去国际空间站
to the International Space Station!

148
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:30,540
这是我遇到过的最意义非凡的事
This is the most amazing thing that's ever happened to me!

149
00:05:30,656 --> 00:05:32,073
除了 当然
Except of -- of course,

150
00:05:33,129 --> 00:05:36,358
非连续两次赢得年度最佳房地产经纪人奖
...winning two non-consecutive Realtor of the Year Awards.

151
00:05:36,523 --> 00:05:38,142
我要哭了
I'm-I'm going to cry.

152
00:05:38,220 --> 00:05:40,740
先别哭 抱歉 刚才收音出了问题
Uh, don't cry yet. I'm so sorry. We had a sound issue.

153
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:41,520
我们能全重拍一次吗
Can we do all that again?

154
00:05:41,780 --> 00:05:44,160
好的 要从拥抱开始重拍吗
Yeah! Should we take it back to the hug?

155
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:50,060
我今天演出的票开始预定了
So, tickets for my show today are at will call.

156
00:05:50,060 --> 00:05:52,240
好消息 我给你们预备了免费票
And good news -- I was able to get you comps.

157
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:54,560
我肯定会以其他方式付出代价
I'm sure it'll cost me in other ways.

158
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,400
是老爸发来的 "我马上就到"
It's from Dad. "I'm almost there."

159
00:05:56,540 --> 00:05:59,680
假如"马上"是个地名 哈维尔肯定是市长
If "almost there" was a place, Javier would be the mayor.

160
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:02,340
请不要再无来由对他辱骂了
Please stop taking pot shots at his expense.

161
00:06:02,740 --> 00:06:05,540
他这家伙 除了拿来骂也没别的作用了
Pot shots are the only thing that we can take at his expense.

162
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:08,518
我是认真的 妈 乔都被你的行为毒害了
I mean it, Mom. You've even poisoned Joe.

163
00:06:08,518 --> 00:06:10,580
是被她的烹饪水平毒害了吧
You mean with her cooking?

164
00:06:10,580 --> 00:06:12,040
我们只能嘲笑哈维尔
Hey, we're only making fun of Javier!

165
00:06:13,060 --> 00:06:14,180
不行
No, we're not.

166
00:06:14,760 --> 00:06:16,420
-向我保证 -好吧 我保证
- Promise me. - Okay, fine, I promise.

167
00:06:16,420 --> 00:06:18,980
假如我毫无恶意的玩笑让你不舒服
If my good-natured ribbing is making you uncomfortable,

168
00:06:18,980 --> 00:06:20,240
我会悬崖勒马的
I will refrain.

169
00:06:21,527 --> 00:06:23,280
我给她买了每日一成语
I've got her on Word a Day cards.

170
00:06:23,280 --> 00:06:24,520
我们看看能坚持多久
We'll see how long it holds.

171
00:06:26,420 --> 00:06:27,380
歌洛莉亚
Hola, Gloria.

172
00:06:27,380 --> 00:06:28,740
哈维尔
Oh, Javier, hi--

173
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:30,940
假牙不错
Nice teeth.

174
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:33,720
在牙医诊所装的还是钢琴店装的
Did you get them at the dentist or at the piano store?

175
00:06:34,100 --> 00:06:36,320
自打上次摩门教徒上门传教后
I haven't seen anything so white and square

176
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:38,500
我还没见过如此又白又死性的东西
since the Mormons knocked on my door.

177
00:06:38,500 --> 00:06:41,000
这些还只是我信手拈来的吐槽
And those were just off the top of my head,

178
00:06:41,251 --> 00:06:42,928
但我向曼尼保证了 所以忍了
but I promised Manny, so -- Pbht!

179
00:06:43,340 --> 00:06:44,940
见到你真高兴 快请进
Nice to see you. Come in.

180
00:06:45,240 --> 00:06:47,040
-爸 -乖儿子
- Hey, Dad! - There's my boy!

181
00:06:50,498 --> 00:06:54,141
某人用了我定制的古龙香水
Someone has been wearing my custom-made cologne --

182
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,040
哈维尔之香
Javier!

183
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:58,220
给想闻起来有点女人味的男人
For the man who wants to smell a little bit like a woman.

184
00:06:58,420 --> 00:06:59,540
多谢你来看我的演出 爸
Thanks for coming to my show, Dad.

185
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:00,840
当然 我怎么会错过
Of course. I wouldn't miss it.

186
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:03,200
不过 我进城来还有其他理由
But, hey, that is not the only reason I am in town.

187
00:07:03,580 --> 00:07:05,800
我有个提议
I, um... I have a proposition --

188
00:07:06,180 --> 00:07:07,780
你好好咀嚼一下
something for you to chew on.

189
00:07:08,880 --> 00:07:10,620
你不能替我们咀嚼吗
Couldn't you chew on it for us

190
00:07:10,620 --> 00:07:12,820
毕竟你刚装了一口海狸一样的大牙
with your giant, new beaver mouth?

191
00:07:13,520 --> 00:07:15,620
我为什么要做出那种傻承诺
I don't know why I made that stupid promise.

192
00:07:15,620 --> 00:07:16,759
金句源源不绝
I am on fire!

193
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:20,140
我在高赌注牌局里拿到了同花顺
I was in a high-stakes poker game with a King-high Flush.

194
00:07:20,140 --> 00:07:21,916
于是我押上了房子
So I bet my house.

195
00:07:21,916 --> 00:07:23,220
不不不不
No, no, no, no, no.

196
00:07:23,220 --> 00:07:24,598
你不能睡在曼尼的房间
You're not living in Manny's room.

197
00:07:24,598 --> 00:07:28,200
我赢下了为期一年的环球航行
I won a year-long cruise around the world.

198
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:30,900
我希望你能伴我完成整个旅程
I want you to set sail with me for the entire voyage!

199
00:07:31,140 --> 00:07:32,977
-什么 -绝对不行
- What?! - Absolutely not.

200
00:07:32,977 --> 00:07:34,840
我该让百货公司的闺蜜
I should ask my gal at Nordstrom

201
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:36,140
为我准备几身航海行头
to pull some cruise looks for me.

202
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:38,040
看看他 急得牙痒痒
Look at him, he's chomping at the bit.

203
00:07:38,220 --> 00:07:39,480
再这样金句要憋不住了
Stop setting me up!

204
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:46,060
给 老式咖啡
Here you go. A cup of joe, the old-fashioned way.

205
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:47,140
谢了 玛格丽特
Oh, thanks, Margaret.

206
00:07:49,695 --> 00:07:52,700
老天 这里加了波本酒吗
Oh, God. I-Is there bourbon in this?

207
00:07:52,700 --> 00:07:54,118
你跟我要咖啡的时候
When you asked for coffee,

208
00:07:54,118 --> 00:07:56,780
不是给了我眼神示意吗
didn't you give me a "wink-wink"?

209
00:07:56,780 --> 00:07:58,460
没有 这可是大早上
No. It's the morning.

210
00:07:58,600 --> 00:08:00,260
所以酒里才加了咖啡
Well, that's why there's coffee in it.

211
00:08:01,220 --> 00:08:03,700
请你帮我订个午餐好吗
Could you just make me a lunch reservation, please?

212
00:08:04,620 --> 00:08:05,740
没问题
No problem.

213
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,600
那是什么
What's that thing?

214
00:08:07,940 --> 00:08:11,620
这些餐厅都很棒 杰以前总去
Oh, these are all the great restaurants that Jay used to go to.

215
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:14,240
你喜欢黛安汁牛排吗
Do you like Steak Diane?

216
00:08:15,900 --> 00:08:19,180
她选了十二家才选到有沙拉的餐厅
It took her 12 tries to find a place that had a salad.

217
00:08:21,308 --> 00:08:22,400
你在做什么
Uh, w-what are you doing?

218
00:08:22,400 --> 00:08:24,360
我刚把沙发铺好
Oh, I was just getting the couch ready

219
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:25,880
给你午后"开会"时用
for your afternoon "meeting."

220
00:08:26,160 --> 00:08:28,440
你为什么说得好像我不是真要开会
Why are you saying "meeting" like it's not really a meeting?

221
00:08:29,220 --> 00:08:30,200
跟你解释一下
Just so you know,

222
00:08:30,300 --> 00:08:32,680
我的话都是字面意思 没有隐藏含义
when I say something, that's exactly what I mean.

223
00:08:33,200 --> 00:08:34,760
另外 你在车上给我打电话时
Also, when you called me from your car,

224
00:08:34,780 --> 00:08:36,000
我听不清你说什么
I couldn't really understand you.

225
00:08:36,180 --> 00:08:37,380
你或许该重新弄一下蓝牙
You may want to fix your Bluetooth.

226
00:08:38,620 --> 00:08:39,600
你注意到了
You noticed?

227
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:42,260
几年前牙神经死掉了
The nerve died a few years ago.

228
00:08:42,260 --> 00:08:44,980
假如你看着碍眼 我可以拔掉
But if it bothers you, I'll have it yanked.

229
00:08:46,500 --> 00:08:49,020
曼尼 你的戏讲的是什么
So, Manny, what is your show about?

230
00:08:49,460 --> 00:08:51,420
戏里有海盗和唯美的裸戏吗
Will there be pirates and tasteful nudity?

231
00:08:51,700 --> 00:08:53,380
跟我的上部戏不一样
It'll be different from my last one.

232
00:08:53,422 --> 00:08:54,703
这次是独角戏
This is a one-man play

233
00:08:54,703 --> 00:08:57,180
我会扮演咖啡馆里的四个角色
in which I portray four characters in a café

234
00:08:57,180 --> 00:08:58,440
他们来自各行各业
from different walks of life.

235
00:08:58,720 --> 00:08:59,800
当没有网络信号时
When the Internet goes out,

236
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:01,300
他们被迫和彼此聊天
they're forced to talk to each other.

237
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,621
我给戏取名为
I call it

238
00:09:02,621 --> 00:09:05,040
《谁什么何时哪里为何无线网》
"Who, What, When, Where, Wi-Fi."

239
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:05,880
要是我就加个海盗
I'd throw in a pirate.

240
00:09:06,560 --> 00:09:08,080
我该去进入角色了
I should go get into characters.

241
00:09:10,060 --> 00:09:11,840
不准带曼尼去航行
Manny's not going on that trip.

242
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:14,495
我知道你说的冒险是什么意思
I know what an adventure with you means.

243
00:09:14,495 --> 00:09:16,394
破酒吧 骗徒
Seedy bars, con men,

244
00:09:16,394 --> 00:09:18,413
还有那种赠品笔 一转笔
souvenir pens that when you flip them,

245
00:09:18,413 --> 00:09:20,180
上面的女人就会变成裸体
the lady's clothes come off.

246
00:09:20,180 --> 00:09:22,560
假如我儿子想跟我共度时光
If my son wants to spend some time with me,

247
00:09:22,580 --> 00:09:23,459
他应该有这个自由
he should be able to.

248
00:09:23,459 --> 00:09:25,420
杰 帮我说两句
Jay...back me up.

249
00:09:25,420 --> 00:09:26,638
他不会帮你说话的
He's not gonna back you up.

250
00:09:26,638 --> 00:09:27,980
歌洛莉亚 让曼尼去航行吧
Gloria, let Manny go on the trip.

251
00:09:27,980 --> 00:09:30,560
他不会有事的 他十岁起就像四十岁一样
He'll be fine. He's been 40 since he was 10.

252
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:32,740
而他四十年来都像十岁一样
And he's been 10 for 40 years.

253
00:09:32,740 --> 00:09:33,800
没门
It's not happening.

254
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:35,760
我明白你担心什么
Look, I understand your concern,

255
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:38,220
但我想趁我还有时间 跟曼尼增进感情
but I want to bond with Manny before it's too late.

256
00:09:39,412 --> 00:09:41,636
我可能进入了中年危机
I think I'm having a mid-life crisis.

257
00:09:41,860 --> 00:09:44,057
你或许没注意到 但我做了牙贴面
You probably didn't notice, but I got veneers.

258
00:09:44,057 --> 00:09:46,006
我还在纳闷你哪里不一样了
Oh, that's what that is!

259
00:09:47,340 --> 00:09:48,800
拜托不要死在我们房子里
Please don't die in our house.

260
00:09:48,960 --> 00:09:50,060
你们有什么可在乎的
What the hell do you care?

261
00:09:50,160 --> 00:09:52,060
首先 假如我们以后想卖房子
For starters, if we ever want to sell this place,

262
00:09:52,180 --> 00:09:53,640
我们必须披露这里死过人
we'll have to disclose that someone died here.

263
00:09:53,680 --> 00:09:55,000
为什么 上任房主就没披露
Why? The last owners didn't.

264
00:09:55,100 --> 00:09:57,020
我说了一百万次了 没闹鬼 椅子是我挪的
For the millionth time, I moved that chair.

265
00:09:57,100 --> 00:10:00,000
我妻子几年前去世了 我无亲无故
My wife passed years ago. I don't have any other family.

266
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:02,700
我只想闭上眼睛 缓缓离开人世
I just want to close my eyes and drift off.

267
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:05,082
有很多理由让你继续活下去
There are lots of reasons to want to continue to live.

268
00:10:05,082 --> 00:10:06,420
我知道你想念妻子了
I know you miss your missus,

269
00:10:06,420 --> 00:10:08,340
但独自生活比想象得好多了
but living alone is underrated.

270
00:10:08,480 --> 00:10:10,680
例如 你晚饭想吃什么就可以吃什么
For one, you can have whatever you want for dinner.

271
00:10:11,180 --> 00:10:13,400
第二 你想把沙发挪到哪都行
Two, you can move the couch wherever you'd like.

272
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:14,318
已经十年了
It's been 10 years.

273
00:10:14,318 --> 00:10:15,940
你说沙发挪到哪能更好看
Where-where would the couch look better?

274
00:10:15,940 --> 00:10:18,600
我很感谢你们这不怎么样的鼓励
I appreciate what you think passes for support.

275
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:20,360
我只是没有兴趣了
I'm just not interested.

276
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:22,480
我认为你需要更积极的人生观
I think you need a more positive outlook on life.

277
00:10:22,800 --> 00:10:24,640
我们邻居赫歇尔和你年纪差不多
Our neighbor Herschel, he's about your age.

278
00:10:24,820 --> 00:10:26,440
-赫歇尔·布雷弗曼 -是的
- Herschel Braverman? - Yeah.

279
00:10:26,540 --> 00:10:28,539
-我们一起长大的 -我们很喜欢赫歇尔
- We grew up together. - We love Herschel!

280
00:10:28,539 --> 00:10:30,080
我们每次去熟食店
We-we bring him a corned beef sandwich

281
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,040
都给他买咸牛肉三明治
every time we go to the deli.

282
00:10:31,100 --> 00:10:32,960
是的 你看 这就是活下去的理由
Yeah, see? There's something to live for.

283
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:35,160
-是啊 -你该去和朋友重聚
- Yeah. - You should go reunite with your old friend.

284
00:10:35,160 --> 00:10:36,420
-现在就去 -不如这样
- Right now. - Okay, you know what?

285
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:38,197
别这么无礼 我们陪他去
Don't be rude. We'll walk him over.

286
00:10:38,197 --> 00:10:40,040
他只是想赶去裤子大特卖
He's just in a hurry to get to a pants sale

287
00:10:40,040 --> 00:10:41,320
特卖已经开始三十分钟了
that started 30 minutes ago.

288
00:10:41,380 --> 00:10:42,780
你是啥 32吗
What are you, a 32?

289
00:10:42,940 --> 00:10:43,540
是的
I am.

290
00:10:44,380 --> 00:10:46,280
32岁 美好年华已经随风散去
All the good stuff's already gone.

291
00:10:48,620 --> 00:10:50,500
如果你们想跟上俄罗斯人的节奏
If you guys want to keep up with the Russians,

292
00:10:50,500 --> 00:10:52,090
就必须练练
you're gonna have to train.

293
00:10:52,460 --> 00:10:53,540
我去拿伏特加
I'll get the vodka!

294
00:10:55,100 --> 00:10:57,640
如果我能造一个仿真女机器人
If I could build a fembot with lifelike skin,

295
00:10:57,640 --> 00:10:58,780
就要造得跟她一样
it would be just like her.

296
00:10:58,900 --> 00:11:00,560
你觉不觉得克莱尔怪怪的
Did you get a weird vibe from Claire?

297
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:03,100
没啊 她的态度很积极很支持你
No, she seemed super positive and supportive.

298
00:11:03,300 --> 00:11:04,620
就是这样才不正常
That's exactly what I mean.

299
00:11:05,691 --> 00:11:08,914
趁我在厨房 顺便看看有没有果珍饮料
Oh, while I'm here, I'm gonna see if we have any Tang!

300
00:11:09,120 --> 00:11:11,420
我不想去太空 克莱尔 我好害怕
I don't want to go to space, Claire! I'm terrified!

301
00:11:11,540 --> 00:11:13,260
如果我把东西弄坏导致我们不能呼吸怎么办
What happens if I break something and we can't breathe?

302
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:16,360
天啊 天啊 我现在喘不过气了
Oh, my God. Oh, my God. I can't breathe right now.

303
00:11:16,500 --> 00:11:19,340
亲爱的 冷静 俄罗斯人很懂行啦
Honey, calm down! The Russians know what they're doing!

304
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:20,600
我会死在那儿的
I'm going to die up there!

305
00:11:20,720 --> 00:11:22,400
告诉他你不想去就好了
Just tell him you don't want to go.

306
00:11:22,500 --> 00:11:24,600
这个礼物太棒了 他一定会受打击的
This is such an amazing gift, it'll crush him.

307
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:26,500
而且我会在那部纪录片里像个懦夫
Plus, I'll look like a coward in that documentary.

308
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:28,418
你说得对 我们在片子里不能是那种形象
You're right, we don't want to see this on film.

309
00:11:28,418 --> 00:11:30,307
我脑海中已经想把这难看的片子覆盖了
I'm taping over it already in my mind.

310
00:11:30,307 --> 00:11:32,080
-你必须阻止这件事 -什么
- You've gotta shut this down. - What?!

311
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:34,060
帮帮我克莱尔 你是我唯一的希望
Help me, Claire. You're my only hope.

312
00:11:34,060 --> 00:11:34,900
好吧
Fine.

313
00:11:35,980 --> 00:11:36,520
但如果我帮了你
But if I do this,

314
00:11:36,620 --> 00:11:38,100
你就不许再跟我引用《星球大战》里的台词
you're not allowed to quote "Star Wars" to me anymore.

315
00:11:38,380 --> 00:11:40,180
-我爱你 -我知道[星球大战台词]
- I love you. - I know.

316
00:11:43,035 --> 00:11:44,616
肯尼思
Hey...Kenneth.

317
00:11:44,616 --> 00:11:46,501
我刚才在那儿和巴兹[扫兴]·奥尔德林聊过了
I was just talking to Buzz-kill Aldrin over here --

318
00:11:46,501 --> 00:11:48,440
克莱尔 我希望你不要介意
Claire, I-I hope you don't mind terribly,

319
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:50,080
但我刚才瞄了一下你的简历
but I was just taking a peek at your resume.

320
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:51,740
非常厉害
It is very impressive.

321
00:11:51,980 --> 00:11:53,007
你工作已经有着落了吗
Have you landed anywhere?

322
00:11:53,007 --> 00:11:54,680
目前还没有
Uh, not yet, no.

323
00:11:54,680 --> 00:11:57,320
-说到着落[降落] 很可惜 -真的吗
- You know, speaking of landings, unfortunately -- - Wow, really?

324
00:11:57,740 --> 00:12:00,240
我们应该谈谈一个很有趣的工作机会
Well, we should talk about a really interesting job opportunity

325
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,600
正好我们公司有个空缺
that just opened up at my company.

326
00:12:01,640 --> 00:12:02,980
那太好了
I would love that.

327
00:12:02,980 --> 00:12:06,140
我一直在找一个敢于抓住机会的候选人
I'm looking for a bold candidate who loves to take chances.

328
00:12:06,420 --> 00:12:08,960
不 你正看着的
No, you are looking at a bold candidate

329
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:10,400
就是一个敢于抓住机会的候选人
who loves to take chances.

330
00:12:11,619 --> 00:12:13,500
我知道 但克莱尔还是
I know, but, still, um, Claire has --

331
00:12:13,500 --> 00:12:14,900
克莱尔有一些担忧
Claire has some concerns.

332
00:12:16,560 --> 00:12:19,020
如果我为你工作 我还能跟你拥抱吗
If I'm working for you, do I still get hugs?

333
00:12:19,020 --> 00:12:20,418
不能 这个季节不能
No, not in this climate. Oh.

334
00:12:20,418 --> 00:12:22,683
我只能跟你来个女人式握手
Best I can offer is a wo-man shake!

335
00:12:22,683 --> 00:12:24,082
什么
Ha! What?

336
00:12:26,208 --> 00:12:26,700
什么
Whoa! What?

337
00:12:26,700 --> 00:12:29,080
-你学得真快 -我是怎么做到的
- Wow, you are a quick study. - How am I doing this?!

338
00:12:31,380 --> 00:12:33,660
记住 把它放进碎纸机 不是传真机
Remember, shred this, don't fax it.

339
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:34,620
嗨 亲爱的
Hey, honey.

340
00:12:34,652 --> 00:12:36,100
-嗨 杰 -外公
- Hi, Jay. - Grandpa.

341
00:12:36,100 --> 00:12:37,020
给我倒杯咖啡 玛格丽特
Cup of coffee, Margaret?

342
00:12:38,540 --> 00:12:39,658
外公 你来这有事吗
Grandpa, what are you doing here?

343
00:12:39,658 --> 00:12:42,260
今天在曼尼的独角戏上发生了一件惨不忍睹的事
A terrible thing happened today at Manny's one-man show --

344
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:43,400
他给了我一张票
he got me a ticket.

345
00:12:44,100 --> 00:12:46,680
没事 我就是路过看看玛格丽特做得有多好
No, I just stopped in to see how Margaret's working out.

346
00:12:46,780 --> 00:12:47,540
根本不好
She's not.

347
00:12:47,900 --> 00:12:50,060
虽然我很享受她用夏布利酒
As much as I enjoyed her pairing the glass of Chablis

348
00:12:50,060 --> 00:12:51,270
配给我准备的惊喜鸡尾酒虾
with my surprise shrimp cocktail,

349
00:12:51,775 --> 00:12:54,093
但这不是我需要的助理技能
that's not a skill I need in an assistant.

350
00:12:54,660 --> 00:12:55,900
你必须把她炒了
You have to fire her.

351
00:12:55,920 --> 00:12:57,780
不行 她为我工作了一辈子
I can't. She worked for me her whole life.

352
00:12:57,780 --> 00:13:00,580
她曾睡在人行道上给我买南茜·辛纳特拉的票
She slept on the sidewalk to get me Nancy Sinatra tickets.

353
00:13:00,860 --> 00:13:01,900
好吧 我来说
Fine. I'll do it.

354
00:13:02,460 --> 00:13:03,840
玛格丽特 能请你过来一下吗
Margaret, could you come in here, please?

355
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:05,520
这是我今天不忍看到的第二件事
This is the second thing today I can't watch.

356
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:07,840
能做的我都做了
I did everything I could for you.

357
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:09,420
她是个冷血的人
She's a cold one.

358
00:13:10,100 --> 00:13:11,660
怎么了
What's going on here?

359
00:13:12,180 --> 00:13:13,080
我被开除了吗
Am I fired?

360
00:13:13,520 --> 00:13:14,420
恐怕是的
I'm afraid so.

361
00:13:14,720 --> 00:13:16,060
感谢老天
Oh, thank God!

362
00:13:16,340 --> 00:13:18,640
我已经想退休好几年了
I've been wanting to retire for years now,

363
00:13:18,640 --> 00:13:20,520
但我不想让杰失望
but I could never let Jay down.

364
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:24,140
我只想睡觉 照顾我的大麻花园
I just want to sleep, tend my cannabis garden,

365
00:13:24,140 --> 00:13:25,980
从此再也不工作
and never work again.

366
00:13:25,980 --> 00:13:28,540
玛格丽特 我想让你来我狗床生意做事
Margaret, I want you back at Dog Beds.

367
00:13:29,340 --> 00:13:30,900
你说了算 杰
Oh, whatever you say, Jay.

368
00:13:31,180 --> 00:13:31,980
明天见
See you tomorrow.

369
00:13:32,160 --> 00:13:32,600
不行
No!

370
00:13:33,060 --> 00:13:34,800
外公 玛格丽特想退休了
Grandpa, Margaret wants to retire.

371
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:37,920
我想要什么不重要 杰的需要才重要
It's not what I want. It's what Jay needs.

372
00:13:38,200 --> 00:13:39,680
你们两个是怎么回事
Ugh, what is wrong with you two?

373
00:13:40,180 --> 00:13:41,180
你不需要助理
You don't need an assistant,

374
00:13:41,180 --> 00:13:42,620
她也不想再工作了
and she doesn't want to work anymore.

375
00:13:42,680 --> 00:13:44,400
是真的吗 你真的不想干了吗
Is this true? Do you really want to hang it up?

376
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:47,100
我的确想做点别的事情
There are some things I wouldn't mind trying.

377
00:13:47,220 --> 00:13:49,000
那你应该去做啊 我自己能行
Well, then you should do it. I'll manage.

378
00:13:49,220 --> 00:13:50,200
不过的确是会感觉有点奇怪
It's going to be weird, though.

379
00:13:50,200 --> 00:13:53,040
毕竟你是我此生携手最久的人
I mean, you're the longest relationship I've ever had.

380
00:13:53,040 --> 00:13:55,460
经历过四任丈夫 三次心脏病发作
Four husbands, three heart attacks,

381
00:13:55,660 --> 00:13:56,840
数不清的情人
countless lovers,

382
00:13:57,140 --> 00:13:59,480
你却一直在我身边陪伴我
and you stood by me through it all.

383
00:14:00,520 --> 00:14:01,680
我爱你 杰
I love you, Jay.

384
00:14:04,020 --> 00:14:05,460
我也爱你 玛格丽特
I love you, too, Margaret.

385
00:14:06,460 --> 00:14:07,760
这一路很精彩
It's been a great run.

386
00:14:07,980 --> 00:14:09,380
而且我们还有米奇尔呢
And we'll always have Mitchell.

387
00:14:09,740 --> 00:14:10,200
什么
What?!

388
00:14:10,600 --> 00:14:11,780
她在闹你呢
She's messing with you.

389
00:14:13,820 --> 00:14:16,140
不是啦 我和她的孩子在很久以前就搬走了
No, our kid moved away a long time ago.

390
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:20,780
把之前我说的话忘了吧
Hey, forget what I told you earlier.

391
00:14:20,780 --> 00:14:22,740
雇好看的那个也没问题
It's okay to hire the hot one.

392
00:14:23,020 --> 00:14:24,700
你可能会交到一辈子的朋友
You may make a friend for life.

393
00:14:27,514 --> 00:14:29,685
你们好啊
Hey, fellas!

394
00:14:29,685 --> 00:14:30,700
你好 赫歇尔
Hey, Herschel!

395
00:14:30,700 --> 00:14:31,680
你们给我带三明治了吗
You bring me a sandwich?

396
00:14:31,820 --> 00:14:33,680
没有 我们今天没去熟食店
Oh, no, we didn't go to the deli today.

397
00:14:34,104 --> 00:14:35,440
别 别 别 等一下
Eh... No, no, no! Wait, wait, wait!

398
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:38,640
但我们来个回忆之旅怎么样
But how about a trip down memory lane instead?

399
00:14:39,754 --> 00:14:40,515
等等 等等 等等
W-Wait, wait, wait.

400
00:14:40,515 --> 00:14:42,625
赫歇尔 看看 我们找来了你的老朋友
Herschel, look, we have your old friend

401
00:14:42,979 --> 00:14:45,389
-莫里·克拉克 -克拉克
- Murray Clark! - Clark!

402
00:14:45,700 --> 00:14:47,540
还真是世事无常
Well, what do you know?

403
00:14:47,700 --> 00:14:48,520
你好 赫歇尔
Hello, Hersch.

404
00:14:48,520 --> 00:14:50,140
好久不见了
It's been a lifetime.

405
00:14:50,980 --> 00:14:53,438
少给我来这套 你这个目中无人的狗杂种
Don't give me that, you smug son of a bitch.

406
00:14:53,438 --> 00:14:55,476
怎么回事
What -- W-What's happening?

407
00:14:55,520 --> 00:14:58,820
这个混蛋曾跟我们的橄榄球队教练说我是共党
This bastard told our football coach I was a communist.

408
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:00,516
害我被踢出球队
Got me kicked off the team.

409
00:15:00,516 --> 00:15:02,000
我没准能成职业选手的
I could've gone pro!

410
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:05,460
我这么做是因为他抢了我送报员的工作
I only did that 'cause he stole my paper route!

411
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:08,200
害得我只能靠送冰养家糊口
I had to deliver ice to support my family.

412
00:15:08,400 --> 00:15:09,780
送冰 你们到底多大了
Deliver ice? How old are you guys?

413
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:11,920
-你个奸诈小人 -你卑鄙告密
- You're a snake! - You're a rat!

414
00:15:11,940 --> 00:15:14,220
他趁我去打仗抢了我的女朋友
He stole my girl when I went to war,

415
00:15:14,220 --> 00:15:16,200
还假装瘸腿躲在家里
and he stayed home with a fake limp.

416
00:15:16,260 --> 00:15:17,500
你应该感谢我
You should be grateful!

417
00:15:17,500 --> 00:15:19,260
那个女人传染给我淋病
That woman gave me the clap.

418
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:21,020
那算是我送你的礼物
That was a little gift from me!

419
00:15:22,500 --> 00:15:24,000
莫里 刚才是怎么回事
Murray, what the heck was that?

420
00:15:24,240 --> 00:15:25,099
这只是个开始
Just the beginning.

421
00:15:25,099 --> 00:15:26,752
什么 什么开始
The beg-- the beginning?

422
00:15:27,375 --> 00:15:30,265
莫里 你在干什么呢 朋友
Oh -- Murray. Uh, what are you doing, buddy?

423
00:15:30,760 --> 00:15:32,820
谁都不许那么跟我说话
Nobody talks to me like that.

424
00:15:35,640 --> 00:15:36,160
好吧
Fine.

425
00:15:36,540 --> 00:15:37,700
我要把它拿走
I'm taking it.

426
00:15:38,539 --> 00:15:39,800
等我回家
And when I get home,

427
00:15:39,800 --> 00:15:42,660
我要帮他报名一大堆邪教
I'm going to sign him up for a bunch of those fringe religions.

428
00:15:42,920 --> 00:15:45,580
看看他喜不喜欢那些唱圣歌的来访者
Let's see how he likes getting all those singing visitors

429
00:15:45,580 --> 00:15:47,360
还有那些免费圣经
and all those free Bibles.

430
00:15:47,500 --> 00:15:49,821
我要把他的余生都毁了
I'm going to ruin the rest of his life.

431
00:15:49,821 --> 00:15:51,800
看啊 米奇尔 他开始为未来做打算了
See, Mitchell, he's making plans for the future.

432
00:15:51,800 --> 00:15:54,160
这就是要有竞争对手的原因 给你活着的动力
That's why you have rivals. It's something to live for.

433
00:15:54,220 --> 00:15:56,000
好了 你只是在给错误的行为找借口
Okay, you're just justifying bad behavior.

434
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:57,320
莫里 米奇尔上班的地方有个人
Okay, Murray, Mitchell has somebody at work

435
00:15:57,320 --> 00:15:58,340
老是偷吃他的花生酱
that keeps stealing his peanut butter,

436
00:15:58,340 --> 00:15:59,820
他又不愿意做出任何行动
and he won't do anything about it.

437
00:15:59,820 --> 00:16:02,740
你想要制止他吗 往里面加点泻药
You want to stop it? Try mixing in some laxatives.

438
00:16:02,920 --> 00:16:05,960
然后在厕所门挂一个"施工中"的标牌
And then put an "under construction" sign on the bathroom door.

439
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:07,980
如果你真的想毁了他的一天...
And if you really want to ruin his day --

440
00:16:07,980 --> 00:16:09,726
等等别急 我把这些写下来
Okay, now, hold on, hold on. Let me write these down.

441
00:16:09,726 --> 00:16:11,520
好 就是你打给他老婆
Alright. You call his wife...

442
00:16:12,573 --> 00:16:14,612
无线网断了
Hey, the Wi-Fi's out.

443
00:16:17,420 --> 00:16:18,940
太衰啦 兄弟
Huge bummer, man.

444
00:16:19,060 --> 00:16:21,280
我本来都快写完我的诗啦
I was just about to finish writing my poem.

445
00:16:22,980 --> 00:16:26,000
你也是写作家吗 真是无巧不成书啊
You're a writer, too? Well, knock me over with a feather.

446
00:16:26,187 --> 00:16:28,520
在下布莱恩·勒马克 剧作家
Blaine Lemarque, playwright.

447
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:30,860
以前河口那边总停电
Power used to go out all the time in the bayou.

448
00:16:31,920 --> 00:16:34,560
真的假的 我正在写一部电影
So crazy, I'm writing a movie set

449
00:16:34,560 --> 00:16:36,400
场景就设在河口 名叫"沼泽警察故事"
in the bayou called "Swamp Cops."

450
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:40,240
我虽然还在电影学院 但我很快就会家喻户晓
I'm in film school, but soon, everyone's gonna know my name --

451
00:16:40,240 --> 00:16:41,060
基思·范克
Keith Fank!

452
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:43,440
我不小心听到你们对话
I couldn't help overhearing.

453
00:16:43,880 --> 00:16:46,660
我叫朗达·詹莫威茨 本地的报纸八卦作家
I'm Rhonda Jamowitz, gossip columnist for the local rag.

454
00:16:46,900 --> 00:16:49,370
你们绝对猜不到昨晚是哪颗"星星"降落此处
You'll never guess which starlet was in here yesterday

455
00:16:49,370 --> 00:16:52,587
还带着新男人与更新版的新鼻子
with a new man and a newer nose.

456
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:56,240
我还一直期待剧会渐入佳境
I was hoping that the play was gonna get better.

457
00:16:56,392 --> 00:16:58,586
以及不会那么多朗达的戏份
With maybe a little less Rhonda.

458
00:16:58,880 --> 00:17:01,020
我知道自己喋喋不休
I know I'm going on and on,

459
00:17:01,020 --> 00:17:03,120
但这是在我母亲过世后
but for the first time since Mother passed,

460
00:17:03,120 --> 00:17:04,460
我第一次不再感到孤单
I don't feel alone.

461
00:17:05,080 --> 00:17:05,440
太棒了
Brilliant.

462
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:07,760
哪怕没有裸戏也完全没问题
I don't miss the nudity at all.

463
00:17:07,760 --> 00:17:09,960
我们太过担忧与人关系密切
We're so worried about staying connected,

464
00:17:10,140 --> 00:17:12,420
丝毫不顾我们立起来的心墙
ignoring the walls that are being erected.

465
00:17:12,600 --> 00:17:14,980
我们被资讯给弄得晕头转向
We let the information confound us,

466
00:17:14,980 --> 00:17:17,780
却忽略环绕在我们身边的爱
when there's so much love swirling around us,

467
00:17:17,780 --> 00:17:20,760
而我们其实唯一需要做的是...
that all we need to do is --

468
00:17:21,430 --> 00:17:22,789
网又好了
Wi-Fi's back on!

469
00:17:33,120 --> 00:17:35,029
我怪我自己
I blame myself.

470
00:17:35,029 --> 00:17:36,604
"学校成绩好吗 送你一顶帽子"
"You got an A? Have a hat."

471
00:17:36,604 --> 00:17:38,729
"你膝盖擦破了吗 送你一顶帽子"
"You skinned your knee? Have a hat."

472
00:17:39,980 --> 00:17:41,620
抱歉让你们久等了
Sorry for making you guys wait.

473
00:17:41,900 --> 00:17:43,380
意外地花了比我预料的时间还久
It took me a little longer than I thought

474
00:17:43,380 --> 00:17:44,620
才能回到曼尼这个身份
to find my way back to Manny.

475
00:17:44,760 --> 00:17:45,780
太棒 太赞了
Bravo, bravo!

476
00:17:46,100 --> 00:17:47,320
又一次大成功
Another triumph, eh?

477
00:17:47,340 --> 00:17:47,740
谢谢
Thanks.

478
00:17:48,180 --> 00:17:50,080
我真的觉得这次的作品不一般
You know, I really think I have something here.

479
00:17:50,340 --> 00:17:51,612
我看与其坐游轮去玩
Maybe instead of going on that cruise,

480
00:17:51,612 --> 00:17:52,660
我还是留在家里继续打磨这...
I should stay home and work on --

481
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:54,260
你必须得去
You are going on that cruise!

482
00:17:55,036 --> 00:17:56,639
这对你很有好处啊
It's gonna be good for you.

483
00:17:56,680 --> 00:17:58,260
你爸爸为这事也废了很多心思
it's so important for your father.

484
00:17:58,480 --> 00:18:00,260
他都计划了一整个冒险呢
He planned a whole adventure!

485
00:18:00,500 --> 00:18:02,120
我们会在洪都拉斯喝龙舌兰
We'll drink tequila in Honduras.

486
00:18:02,520 --> 00:18:04,140
在巴厘岛与海豚共游
We'll swim with the dolphins in Bali.

487
00:18:04,140 --> 00:18:05,960
但当我们到了巴拿马运河那里
But when we travel through the Panama Canal,

488
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:08,380
我们会需要做点简单的家政服务工作
we'll be required to do some light housekeeping.

489
00:18:08,380 --> 00:18:09,020
这是定好的条件
It's part of the deal.

490
00:18:09,740 --> 00:18:10,760
好吧
Okay, then.

491
00:18:10,760 --> 00:18:11,820
我去拿一下我的东西
I'll just go grab my stuff

492
00:18:11,820 --> 00:18:13,280
然后跟我的粉丝合影一下
and take some selfies with my fan.

493
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:16,340
歌洛莉亚
Gloria, dime --

494
00:18:16,780 --> 00:18:19,100
为什么你突然对游轮旅改变态度了
why are you suddenly so on board with this trip?

495
00:18:19,260 --> 00:18:21,000
他这一生被我保护成温室里的花朵
I've sheltered him for too long.

496
00:18:21,340 --> 00:18:24,360
他需要有值得写出来的真实冒险
He needs something real that he can write about.

497
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:27,278
带他去最龙蛇混杂的酒吧
Take him to the seediest bars,

498
00:18:27,278 --> 00:18:29,540
把他介绍给骗徒
introduce him to con men.

499
00:18:29,540 --> 00:18:31,440
让他体会到危险
Let him taste danger.

500
00:18:31,440 --> 00:18:35,720
但别让他吃虾 他一吃虾眼皮就会肿
But not shrimp, because it makes his eyelid feel funny.

501
00:18:37,201 --> 00:18:38,415
先生 不许你戴
No, senor!

502
00:18:38,500 --> 00:18:40,380
我绝不会让这个恶习传承下来
The cycle ends here!

503
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:45,920
你不是吧 你就这么卖我求荣吗
Really? You just sold me out for a job?

504
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:47,991
亲爱的 他想要个冒险家
Honey, he wants a risk-taker.

505
00:18:47,991 --> 00:18:50,648
如果我毁了你们俩男孩的旅行 我多罪大恶极啊
How's it going to look if I squash your boys' trip?

506
00:18:50,766 --> 00:18:53,218
什么男孩旅行 这可是离开地球
Boys' trip?! We're leaving the planet!

507
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:55,600
你知道过山车最可怕的是什么吗
You know the scariest part of a roller coaster?

508
00:18:55,660 --> 00:18:56,640
是坐整整一个月的过山车
It's a month of that!

509
00:18:56,920 --> 00:18:58,420
老爸 你不想去太空吗
Dad, you don't want to go to space?

510
00:18:58,540 --> 00:18:59,129
我想去啊
No, I do.

511
00:18:59,129 --> 00:19:00,620
我只是... 有点担心
I-I just -- I worry

512
00:19:00,620 --> 00:19:02,480
这种等爸爸回家的经历会造成心理创伤...
that it might be too traumatic for you --

513
00:19:02,760 --> 00:19:04,099
不会啊 会是很值得跟孩子们说的故事
Oh, no, it'll be fun to tell the kids

514
00:19:04,099 --> 00:19:05,603
他们的外公是个宇航员
their Pop-Pop is an astronaut.

515
00:19:05,603 --> 00:19:07,659
爆爆[外公]很可能会是我此生最后发出的声音
Pop-Pop might be the last sound I make.

516
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:09,660
克莱尔 如果不麻烦
Claire, if it's not too much trouble,

517
00:19:09,680 --> 00:19:12,520
能请你帮我选好一张全家福照片吗
would you please, um, pick out a family photo for me to clutch

518
00:19:12,520 --> 00:19:15,720
当我系绳断了 无止尽在太空翻转时可以拿着
after my tether snaps and I tumble endlessly through the void?

519
00:19:15,840 --> 00:19:17,640
比较有可能的应该是
It is much more likely

520
00:19:17,806 --> 00:19:20,800
当你重新进入大气层时 直接被烧成灰烬
that you will just incinerate upon re-entry.

521
00:19:20,800 --> 00:19:21,880
你们在聊上太空的事吗
You guys talking about space?

522
00:19:22,620 --> 00:19:23,080
是啊
Yeah.

523
00:19:24,075 --> 00:19:25,180
听我说 兄弟
Um...look, buddy,

524
00:19:25,180 --> 00:19:28,400
我很感谢这一切 但我不想去
I appreciate all this, but I don't want to go.

525
00:19:28,400 --> 00:19:28,800
什么
What?

526
00:19:29,300 --> 00:19:31,569
对不起 我真的很怕
I'm sorry. I'm just so scared.

527
00:19:31,569 --> 00:19:32,837
但你是我的定海神针
But y-you're my rock.

528
00:19:32,837 --> 00:19:34,980
我不... 没有你我做不到
I-I can't -- I can't do this without you.

529
00:19:34,980 --> 00:19:35,840
我是你的定海神针吗
I'm your rock?

530
00:19:36,493 --> 00:19:38,356
我给我们添了什么麻烦啊
What did I get us into?

531
00:19:39,020 --> 00:19:40,800
我其实都不想去
I didn't even want to go.

532
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:44,260
我只是想在贝佐斯
I just wanted to look cool in front of Bezos

533
00:19:44,627 --> 00:19:47,367
伊隆与扎扎面前耍酷罢了
and Elon and Zuck-Zuck.

534
00:19:47,820 --> 00:19:49,780
你是为了这种原因才想去的吗
That's the reason why you're going?

535
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:52,680
恕我直言 把白男发射到太空中
I'm sorry, but launching white dudes into space

536
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:53,898
已经不酷很多年了
hasn't been cool for years.

537
00:19:53,898 --> 00:19:55,251
但镜头在拍
But the cameras.

538
00:19:55,560 --> 00:19:56,820
我怎么样才能安全下庄
How am I going to get out of this?

539
00:19:56,820 --> 00:19:58,660
如果你只是想耍帅
Well, if you're trying to look cool,

540
00:19:58,800 --> 00:20:00,360
你就举办一个华丽的活动
just throw some splashy event

541
00:20:00,360 --> 00:20:02,100
把去太空的机会拍卖掉再捐给慈善机构就行
and auction off the space trip to charity.

542
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:03,220
感觉能行
That could work.

543
00:20:03,700 --> 00:20:04,540
哪种慈善机构啊
What kind of charity?

544
00:20:04,960 --> 00:20:05,800
最近跟狼有关的慈善机构挺火
Wolves are hot right now.

545
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:06,880
我喜欢
I love that.

546
00:20:07,140 --> 00:20:08,700
我要拯救狼群
I'm going to save the wolves!

547
00:20:09,040 --> 00:20:10,660
我们是要拯救 不是要灭狼 对吧
We're saving them, right? Yeah.

548
00:20:10,860 --> 00:20:13,120
我喜欢你这样不走寻常路
I like the way you think outside the box.

549
00:20:13,120 --> 00:20:15,989
我可能有个很不错的工作岗位可以给你
I may have a really interesting job opportunity for you.

550
00:20:15,989 --> 00:20:18,080
海莉 我们说不定可以一起工作呢
Haley, we could be working together!

551
00:20:18,080 --> 00:20:19,700
没 这是个一个人的职位
No, it's really just the one job.

552
00:20:19,871 --> 00:20:23,346
菲尔 虽然不是太空之旅
And, Phil, while it's not a trip to space,

553
00:20:23,637 --> 00:20:26,700
但我希望菲尔·邓菲狼群中心
I hope that the Phil Dunphy Center for Wolves

554
00:20:26,700 --> 00:20:29,660
能够配得上你改变我人生的恩情
will be a fitting honor for the man who changed my life.

555
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:31,300
我们会举办一个盛大开幕仪式
We'll have a big opening ceremony.

556
00:20:32,440 --> 00:20:33,660
你们可以看看所有的狼们
You'll meet all the wolves!

557
00:20:33,900 --> 00:20:35,920
我们到镜头前再来演一次吧
Now let's go do this again in front of the cameras!

558
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:41,980
我很怕狼
I'm terrified of wolves!

559
00:20:44,980 --> 00:20:46,480
太好了 你来了
Oh, good, you're here.

560
00:20:46,920 --> 00:20:49,660
曼尼马上要给我展示他新的游轮装
Manny's about to model his new cruise wear for me.

561
00:20:49,840 --> 00:20:50,775
看来有好戏看了
This should be good.

562
00:20:50,775 --> 00:20:53,340
杰 别让他自我羞耻
Jay, don't make him self-conscious.

563
00:20:53,340 --> 00:20:54,660
答应我你会管住自己的嘴
Promise you're going to be nice.

564
00:20:56,220 --> 00:20:57,180
很聪明
Very smart.

565
00:20:57,420 --> 00:20:57,920
谢谢夸张 老妈
Thanks, Mom.

566
00:20:58,260 --> 00:20:59,700
杰 你觉得呢
Jay, what do you think?

567
00:21:00,841 --> 00:21:02,920
袋鼠船长[形似]你好
Hey, El Capitan Kangaroo.

568
00:21:02,920 --> 00:21:04,500
您哪位啊 是奇人异事先生[形似]吗
What are you, the Untalented Mr. Ripley?

569
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:06,737
你甚至应该去巴哈马群岛指挥交通
You should be directing traffic in the Bahamas.

570
00:21:06,737 --> 00:21:08,201
歌手坦尼尔[船长打扮]打来了
Tennille called...

571
00:21:08,293 --> 00:21:09,640
我吐槽过这个了没
D-Did I do that one yet?

572
00:21:09,640 --> 00:21:12,340
总之 她觉得你看起来就像80年代电影里
Anyway, she thinks you look like the kid in an '80s movie

573
00:21:12,340 --> 00:21:13,420
人见人憎的死小孩
we're supposed to hate.

574
00:21:14,700 --> 00:21:16,040
你看起来很赞啊
You look amazing.

575
00:21:16,122 --> 00:21:18,736
赞到像贵族家庭里
Amazing-ly like the last Kennedy picked

576
00:21:18,736 --> 00:21:19,860
玩球时最后被人选进队的废柴
in a touch football game.

577
00:21:19,860 --> 00:21:22,240
这些吐槽太赞了 我必须得去跟他说
These are too good. I gotta tell him.

578
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:24,560
曼尼 再把服装穿上
Manny, put the outfit back on!
